@startuml UC003_Open_Project_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC003 — Open a saved project in the editor

actor "Portfolio owner" as Owner
participant "public/js/app.js" as App
participant "public/js/api.js" as Client
participant "src/server.js" as Server
participant "src/routes/project.routes.js" as API
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Auth
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Owner -> App : Edit project
App -> Client : Load saved project
Client -> Server : GET /api/projects/:id
Server -> API : Dispatch through the projects router
API -> Auth : Verify active session
Auth --> API : Set req.user
API -> Data : findProject(req.user.id, id)
Data -> DB : Read owned project, revision, and associations
DB --> Data : Saved project
Data --> API : Project and revision
API --> Client : 200 OK with project and ETag
Client --> App : Project and revision
App --> Owner : Prefill the UC002 studio form
@enduml
